  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">High Dose Oral Rifampicin to Improve Survival from Adult TB Meningitis - (HARVEST) Trial</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MRC/JGHT 8 award phase III randomized, doubleblind placebocontrolled clinical trial evaluating whether ~3.5x higher oral doserifampicin has a 6month survival benefit as the primary endpoint, additionally pharmacokinetic measurements and safety are included as important secondary endpoints in Indonesia</narrative>
  </description>
